100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 967999197, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 842995571, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1  Client sends its checkpoint\n    { updatedAt, id } + limit (about 100)\n\n2  Server returns documents changed\n    after the checkpoint (active org only)\n\n3  Client upserts docs or applies\n    tombstones, then advances checkpoint\n\n4  syncCache may skip the DB when the\n    tenant has no new changes\n\nOrder in Studio: services before\nagendaEvents (dependency)", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1  Client sends its checkpoint\n    { updatedAt, id } + limit (about 100)\n\n2  Server returns documents changed\n    after the checkpoint (active org only)\n\n3  Client upserts docs or applies\n    tombstones, then advances checkpoint\n\n4  syncCache may skip the DB when the\n    tenant has no new changes\n\nOrder in Studio: services before\nagendaEvents (dependency)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "re49", "type": "rectangle", "x": 523, "y": 680, "width": 450, "height": 500, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f59e0b", "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 40, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 878682897, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 87470396, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "tx50", "type": "text", "x": 539, "y": 690, "width": 48.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 800783, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 953476207, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PUSH", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "PUSH", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "tx51", "type": "text", "x": 543, "y": 734, "width": 367.2, "height": 318.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 739686957, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 117075502, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1  Client sends changeRows with\n    assumedMasterState\n\n2  Requires an active subscription\n\n3  Server applies the change, or\n    returns a conflict\n\n4  Conflict: server master wins, the\n    client overwrites its local copy\n\n5  Studio sends partial field diffs;\n    Flutter marks pushed rows clean\n\nLock identity: (id, updatedAt)", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1  Client sends changeRows with\n    assumedMasterState\n\n2  Requires an active subscription\n\n3  Server applies the change, or\n    returns a conflict\n\n4  Conflict: server master wins, the\n    client overwrites its local copy\n\n5  Studio sends partial field diffs;\n    Flutter marks pushed rows clean\n\nLock identity: (id, updatedAt)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "re52", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1006, "y": 680, "width": 450, "height": 500, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8b5cf6", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 40, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 431613002, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 45313732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "tx53", "type": "text", "x": 